WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.045 --> 00:00:05.797
('RUDE!' released on February 20th, MV day 1)
We're here on day 1 for RUDE!

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:08.799
Yesterday, we filmed
the trailer video

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:09.925
and today...

00:00:09.926 --> 00:00:11.885
we're filming the MV

00:00:11.886 --> 00:00:15.097
and we've matched uniforms like this

00:00:15.098 --> 00:00:18.016
And we got to have each
of the numbers we wanted on the shirt

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:20.310
but I like the numbers '3' and '7'

00:00:20.311 --> 00:00:22.145
so I went with '37'

00:00:22.146 --> 00:00:24.314
YE-ON said because she's
born in 2010

00:00:24.315 --> 00:00:25.607
She said she went with 10

00:00:25.608 --> 00:00:27.317
And for 'RUDE!' this time, I...

00:00:27.318 --> 00:00:29.609
and many of our members
got our hair dyed

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.280
(YE-ON with choppy bangs)

00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:33.282
YE-ON has choppy bangs on

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:36.159
and many of us got our hair dyed too

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:37.286
So I feel we can show a lot
of our new sides

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:39.288
