00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:42.082
(At a hotel near the MV filming site)
We'll be staying at a lodging today

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:43.500
Want to be roomies?

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:44.543
(Replying automatically like)
Sure

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:45.794
Look at your face

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:47.004
Look how sad you look

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:48.922
Do I look sad...?

00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:49.965
So do you want to be roomies or no

00:00:49.966 --> 00:00:51.383
(Are you sure)
I feel happy

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.635
Today's day 1 of the MV

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:54.845
('RUDE!')
Right, day 1

00:00:54.846 --> 00:00:57.556
We're here for day 1, but
we're already filming the group dance scene

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.391
- we're just filming group dance
- We all have ponytail on

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.059
- Today's day for the dancing
- Right

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.060
Today, YUHA...

