00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:08.692
(According to CARMEN) - Contact
lens too / - Olive green colored contacts too

00:01:08.693 --> 00:01:10.610
(All 8 of us)
we wore this uniform

00:01:10.611 --> 00:01:11.862
