00:01:30.631 --> 00:01:32.549
Tooth gem

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:34.092
Can you see it well?

00:01:35.926 --> 00:01:39.848
(Before the MV filming)
(Leaving a group photo)

00:01:39.849 --> 00:01:44.769
Guys! My jersey number is

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:45.937
number 1

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:47.730
(For first pitch)
when I went to do it with JIWOO back then too

00:01:47.731 --> 00:01:51.192
I had my number as 1 too, and the reason is

00:01:51.193 --> 00:01:53.069
I'm only one

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:54.821
There's only one of me

00:01:54.822 --> 00:01:56.281
And I wanted to be the best

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:59.325
so my uniform number is

00:01:59.326 --> 00:02:01.744
number 1, cat roarrr

00:02:01.745 --> 00:02:03.830
My jersey number is 2

00:02:03.831 --> 00:02:05.498
Because I...

00:02:05.499 --> 00:02:07.375
like 12

00:02:07.376 --> 00:02:09.252
and 20

00:02:09.253 --> 00:02:11.087
but 2 felt like

00:02:11.088 --> 00:02:13.256
